title: 'a-clock MVP: Tauri 2 clock + alarm with custom triggers'
summary: 'Bootstrapped a-clock as a Tauri 2 + React/TypeScript desktop app and shipped the first working slice: a live clock (analog face + digital/numerical toggle, 24h & seconds options) and a full alarm system. Alarms support repeat days, snooze, and three trigger types — a built-in WebAudio beep, a looping YouTube link, or a local audio/video file picked via native dialog and played through the Tauri asset protocol. Added inline + card-level trigger testing so the sound/video can be previewed without waiting. Documented the whole architecture in Paradigm .purpose files (13 components, 3 flows, 3 signals).'
